      "Explicit unknown-pCID policy allows exact-byte store/forward with a visible unsupported result.",
      "Clear dispatch boundary keeps payload opaque until the named handler is available.",
      "Canonical DAG-CBOR bytes support durable relaying and later byte-level audit."
